390
00:26:19,327 --> 00:26:21,204
Te ves tan cómodo.

391
00:26:22,038 --> 00:26:24,666
Hey, espera.

392
00:26:24,749 --> 00:26:27,293
¿Qué estás haciendo?

393
00:26:27,377 --> 00:26:28,962
Vamos.

394
00:26:29,587 --> 00:26:31,297
Oye.

395
00:26:31,381 --> 00:26:34,592
